<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- Plate Calculator. Geometry is Mirone's own, converted from src_figs/plate_calculator.m's
     LayoutFcn (figure 709x317, MATLAB bottom-left origin -> Qt top-left: y_qt = 317 - y_m - h).
     Absolute positions on purpose: the window is fixed-size, exactly as Mirone's ('Resize','off'),
     so every control keeps the size it has there — the edit boxes are 71x21, not stretched.
     `map_holder` marks the axes rectangle [300 46 401 260]; the C++ side puts the plate map there. -->
